干预:
OTHER: Prescription for Action (SPHERES Model)

A system-level intervention consisting of:

* a digital dashboard displaying local health services, outcome indicators, and operational data in a secure Public Health Data Theater;
* structured monthly prescription guides targeting service improvements across three priority program areas;
* monthly performance monitoring with district health leaders. The intervention is applied at the PHC level, all supported by digital capacity building, district-level deployment of implementation teams, and intersectoral secure health data exchange.

入组条件:
Inclusion Criteria:

* Patients with non-valvular paroxysmal or persistent atrial fibrillation who undergo successful ablation of atrial fibrillation, either by cryoablation or by radiofrequency advanced 3D mapping system;
* Ability to provide informed consent;
* Patients aged at least 18 years;

Exclusion Criteria:

* Patients with valvular atrial fibrillation;
